// v3-2 classroom posts: coach-authored, media-backed lessons. Additive only —
// no FK churn on existing community tables. Tenancy mirrors the v1-1 convention:
// scalar workspace_id / cohort_id / coach_id, server-derived, with RLS keyed on
// the shared app.is_community_workspace_coach / _member / shares_community_cohort
// helpers (defined in the v1-1 migration). Pinned lessons sort by pinned_order
// ASC ahead of non-pinned (published_at DESC); release_at gates student reads.
model CommunityClassroomPost {
